        "heading": "Tantan's Salt Pop",
        "description": "<p>Made with blackberry, crisp apple, and a splash of mandarin and lemon juices, Blackberry Vanilla creates a layered blackberry flavor with smooth vanilla notes for an unforgettable soda that'll satisfy every craving.</p>",
